OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786042169
OL,3,CNadia Sawalha starts legal action
OL,4,Cagainst ITV after being taken off
OL,5,CLoose Women
OL,7,FNadia Sawalha has said she has started
OL,8,Flegal action against ITV after she was
OL,9,F"bullied out" of her job at Loose
OL,10,FWomen.
OL,12,FThe presenter and broadcaster is
OL,13,Falleging she has faced discrimination
OL,14,Fafter she was taken off air in July
OL,15,F2026, claiming her vocal support for
OL,16,FPalestine was the reason.
OL,18,FIn a post on her Instagram, Sawalha
OL,19,Fclaimed she had been "messed around"
OL,20,Fby Loose Women's producers for months.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
