FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786042169
OL,3,CNadia Sawalha starts legal action
OL,4,Cagainst ITV after being taken off
OL,5,CLoose Women
OL,7,FShe insisted she had never mentioned
OL,8,Fher support for Palestine on air,
OL,9,Fsaying: "Even though I'm hired for
OL,10,Fbeing an opinionated woman on a
OL,11,Fdiscussion show and I've never brought
OL,12,Fup or spoken about Palestine directly
OL,13,Fon the show."
OL,15,FSawalha has hired the European Legal
OL,16,FSupport Center (ELSC) to assist with
OL,17,Fher case.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
