OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786042169
OL,3,CNadia Sawalha starts legal action
OL,4,Cagainst ITV after being taken off
OL,5,CLoose Women
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FIt said on its website that their pre-
OL,13,Faction letter to ITV claimed the
OL,14,Fbroadcaster "subjected Nadia to direct
OL,15,Fdiscrimination, indirect
OL,16,Fdiscrimination and harassment because
OL,17,Fof her protected philosophical
OL,18,Fbeliefs, namely her anti-Zionist
OL,19,Fbeliefs, which are protected under the
OL,20,FEquality Act 2010".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
