PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1786042169
OL,3,CNadia Sawalha starts legal action
OL,4,Cagainst ITV after being taken off
OL,5,CLoose Women
OL,7,F"We argue that Nadia was treated less
OL,8,Ffavourably than other ITV presenters
OL,9,Fwho faced significant public
OL,10,Fcomplaints, raising serious concerns
OL,11,Fabout equality in the workplace, and
OL,12,Fthe treatment of those who speak out
OL,13,Ffor Palestinian rights," the
OL,14,Forganisation added.
OL,16,FThe ELSC said Sawalha was calling for
OL,17,FITV to apologise and assurances that
OL,18,Fshe will not be taken off air for
OL,19,Ffuture programmes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/4
